Task 2: Install Docker Compose package  
Description Task 2: Install the docker-compose package when the installation type is set to "package". This uses the package module to manage software packages.  

Task 3: Install Docker Compose binary  
Description Task 3: Install Docker Compose as a binary when the installation type is set to "binary". This includes installing required packages and downloading the binary file from a specified URL. The binary is placed in /usr/local/bin and made executable with mode 0755.


